<ADXFORMAT version="1.01">
  <!-- Written 10/25/2026 19:03:17; v3.1 text fixes 10/29/2026 (offsets and ids unchanged); v3.2 10/30/2026: +8 ECU-activity items for payload byte 0x59 (needs firmware v0.4.7; NOT tested in TunerPro); v3.3 10/31/2026: RPMAX scale X (was X * 40) and MAFAX scale X * 4 (was X) = the axis scale of XDF new8-new11, bubble fix; NOT tested in TunerPro; v3.4 10/31/2026: ALL axis items raw (MAFAX X, ECT X + new ECTC degC item), history tables FUELHISTO / MAFHISTORY use the axes of the VE table, to go with XDF new13; v3.5 10/31/2026: coolant degC item back on the dashes (raw code = new item ECTR for the trace), lambda history tables use the VE table axes, + WOT lambda 1 / 2 history tables; NOT tested in TunerPro -->
