    <author>M&#180;]</author>
    <desc>Motronic M2.8.1 + One ROM. METRIC. Live items: Tachometer (0x0A), table axis and cursor items (0x3F-0x47, 0x4D-0x4E), coolant estimate (0x42), AEM lambda (0x48-0x4B), One ROM status and diagnostics (0x4C-0x59; 0x59 = ECU activity bits, firmware v0.4.7). Items marked (no data) come from the 8D Corvette ADX and show constant template bytes.</desc>
    <baud>9600</baud>
    <DEFAULTS datasizeinbits="8" sigdigits="2" outputtype="3" baud="0" signed="0" lsbfirst="0" float="0" />
    <monitorcmd>COMMAND0MAC</monitorcmd>
  </ADXHEADER>

